        <object label="&lt;b&gt;Access &amp; retention&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Authorized staff&lt;/font&gt;" tooltip="Real patient data stays in IRIS; recordings and transcripts have configured retention; access is role-based and audited. Emails carry no clinical content." id="3YLvYWSsD1ZXZJSxB-80-74">
